# local deep-codebase analysis notes
docs/codebase-analysis/

# Xcode build output lives in *.noindex directories so Spotlight skips it.
# Without that, every build leaves a launchable "conch" in Launchpad: Tyler
# had five — a Mac app, three iOS builds, and one stray at the repo root from
# a build run in the wrong directory. Xcode uses the same trick for its own
# DerivedData.
*.noindex/
